84-/** The sum of a person's figures: the figures of their claims that count (each at the rate, of the grade in force,
85- *  on its date, with its late charge) added up; 'n/a' when their grade has no rate today and none of those claims has
86- *  a figure. */
87-function personFigures(claims: Claim[], rates: Rate[] | undefined, person: Person, late: Late, floor: Dated): string {
